我挑戰,認識香港更美一面.</span></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
&nbsp;<span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">香港擁有世界知名山徑, </span>除著名山徑以外, 亦有一些冷門山徑同樣景色怡人, 而山峰與山峰之間的山徑變化多端, 香港百登希望透過參加者自行探索及規劃路線, 享受行山計劃及自我挑戰的樂趣.</span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="color:#23352B;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第四屆香港百登即將於2026年11月1日正式開始, </span>本年度百登名冊內100座山峰, 將有三座山峰改動, 讓參加者可接受不同山峰, 嘗試規劃不同登山路線.</span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">玩法將維持 [年度挑戰]</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">(今屆將改為八個月)</span>, [</span><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">14</span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">日挑戰] 及 [</span><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">96</span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">小時百登連走] , 讓參加者以不同方式進行自我挑戰! &nbsp;各組別玩法及時間上有所改動, 詳情請參閱活動內容.</span></span></h3></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mrmsgkvi" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mrmsgkvi wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:50px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:50px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">活動方式</span></span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mrmshgli" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mrmshgli wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h3 class="font_3 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:28px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">香港百登 </span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">8m </span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">(基本玩法)</span></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">於活動期限時內</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">(2026年11月1日至6月30日)</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">, 不限路線, 次數及次序登上百登名冊內</span></span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">100</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">座山峰的</span></span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">20</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">米直徑範圍內, 持實體號碼布打卡並於每次登山完結後</span></span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">24</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">小時內上傳記錄.</span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
香港百登</span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">14</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">日挑戰<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 於指定活動期限內</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">(2026年11月1日至12月31日)</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">的自選</span></span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">14</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">天內, 不限路線,次數及次序登上百登名冊內</span></span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">100</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">座山峰的</span></span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">20</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">米直徑範圍內, 持實體號碼布打卡並於每次登山完結後</span></span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">24</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">小時內上傳記錄.</span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
百登連走</span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">96</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">小時<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;於指定</span></span></span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">96</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">小時內</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial black,arial-w01-black,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">(2027年3月26日09:00至3月30日09:00)</span></span></span><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:700;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">, 於指定起點及起步時間出發, 在不限路線,不限次數及不限次序之下, 爭取最高分數. 所有打卡記錄須在每次登頂後即時上傳.</span></span></span></span></span></h3></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-ms9kamgx" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-ms9kamgx wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-ms9kamgx" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-ms9kamgx" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-ms9kamgx" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-ms9kamgx" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-ms9kamgxinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-ms9kamgxinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-ms9kb8wb" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-ms9kb8wb wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:50px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:50px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​報名日期</span></span></span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-ms9kca99" class="W4V2qg comp-ms9kca99 wixui-image" title="482454_fab69f2aac1f458ebdff16f549351c11~mv2.png"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="961px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/482454_8add25b42cb641d0a285c5aeb6fcacfa~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_961,h_332,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screenshot%202026-08-01%20072500.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/482454_8add25b42cb641d0a285c5aeb6fcacfa~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_1566,h_541,al_c,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screenshot%202026-08-01%20072500.png 2x" id="img_comp-ms9kca99" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/482454_8add25b42cb641d0a285c5aeb6fcacfa~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_961,h_332,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screenshot%202026-08-01%20072500.png" alt="Screenshot 2026-08-01 072500.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="961" height="332"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-ms9kfdpe" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-ms9kfdpe wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:50px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:50px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">活動日期</span></span></span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-ms9kfl9x" class="W4V2qg comp-ms9kfl9x wixui-image" title="482454_fab69f2aac1f458ebdff16f549351c11~mv2.png"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="961px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/482454_cd642ade3d2b4dd898a09a8f57ea63ea~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_961,h_214,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screenshot%202026-08-01%20072427.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/482454_cd642ade3d2b4dd898a09a8f57ea63ea~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_1594,h_355,al_c,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screenshot%202026-08-01%20072427.png 2x" id="img_comp-ms9kfl9x" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/482454_cd642ade3d2b4dd898a09a8f57ea63ea~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_961,h_214,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screenshot%202026-08-01%20072427.png" alt="Screenshot 2026-08-01 072427.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="961" height="214"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-mrmrlgca" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-mrmrlgca wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mrmrlgca" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mrmrlgca" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mrmrlgca" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mrmrlgca" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mrmrlgcainlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mrmrlgcainlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-mro9xo0g" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mro9xo0g wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:50px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:50px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">活動方法</span></span></span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mrmrlgcd2" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mrmrlgcd2 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h3 class="font_3 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:28px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">香港百登 8m </span></span><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">(基本玩法)</span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 本年度香港百登基本玩法活動期為8個月內, 於活動期內登上百登名冊內100山峰, 完成 <span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">35登</span>將成為達標者, 完成<span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">100登</span>將成為完成者. 為鼓勵參加者提早完成目標, 達標者及完成者獲發的紀念品, 紀念品將按完成時間作級別之分.</span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">香港百登14日挑戰<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>於11月1日至12月31日兩個月內,自選14天進行登山挑戰, 於活動期內登上百登名冊內100山峰, 完成35登將成為達標者, 完成100登將成為完成者,達標者及完成者將獲發的紀念品.</span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:28px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">百登連走 96小時<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>於2027年3月26日至3月30日(復活節假期)96小時內, 於活動期內登上百登名冊內100山峰, 完成35登將成為達標者, 完成100登將成為完成者,達標者及完成者將獲發的紀念品. 此外每座山峰會因應難度而設定分數, 參加者於限時內爭取最佳分數. 優異成績將額外得到禮品獎勵.</span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
&nbsp;</h3></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-mrmrlgcf" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-mrmrlgcf wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mrmrlgcf" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mrmrlgcf" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mrmrlgcf" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mrmrlgcf" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mrmrlgcfinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mrmrlgcfinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-mrmrlgci2" class="W4V2qg comp-mrmrlgci2 wixui-image" title="螢幕擷取畫面 2024-08-23 103834.png"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="971px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/482454_71039a96079148bea7558a1a451f5cbf~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_971,h_489,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/%E7%99%BE%E7%99%BB4%E5%83%B9%E7%9B%AE%E8%A1%A8.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/482454_71039a96079148bea7558a1a451f5cbf~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_1352,h_681,al_c,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/%E7%99%BE%E7%99%BB4%E5%83%B9%E7%9B%AE%E8%A1%A8.png 2x" id="img_comp-mrmrlgci2" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/482454_71039a96079148bea7558a1a451f5cbf~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_971,h_489,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/%E7%99%BE%E7%99%BB4%E5%83%B9%E7%9B%AE%E8%A1%A8.png" alt="百登4價目表.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="971" height="489"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-ms5hpmdd" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-ms5hpmdd wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:50px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__tex